data: {"type": "text_delta_finish", "role": "text", "content": "Use the **API Node** in **Journey Builder** to send journey data to an external or backend service:\n\n1. Save the data you need to send\u2014such as user input\u2014in a journey variable.\n2. Place an **API Node** where the external call should happen.\n3. Configure it to call your target endpoint.\n4. Store the API response in a variable.\n5. Use that response in subsequent journey steps.\n\nFor response handling:\n- Use **HTTP Status Code Branching** to route based on success or error status codes.\n- Use **JSON Handler** to extract individual fields from the returned JSON.\n\nThe exact request payload and response mapping depend on your external API\u2019s contract.\n\n**See it in action:** [Bot Studio](https://demoforge-ui.gupshup.io/shared/adca6f42-7fc6-4f03-bf26-f5123e16071c/autoplay)"}

